<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--
    QA flight recorder (src/Shell/Compat/FlightRecorder.Game.cs). Alt (Option on macOS) plus
    the vanilla screenshot key starts and stops a recording anywhere; stopping opens
    Dialog_RecordingSaved with the saved path unless suppressed. The two Settings keys are the
    suppression toggle's row in both RimWorld Access settings surfaces.
  -->
  <RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.Started>飞行记录器已启动。</RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.Started>
  <RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.Stopped>飞行记录器已停止。</RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.Stopped>
  <RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.StoppedWithPath>飞行记录器已停止。记录已保存至 {0}。</RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.StoppedWithPath>
  <RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.Marker>已记录标记 {0}。</RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.Marker>
  <RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.DialogTitle>记录已保存</RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.DialogTitle>
  <RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.DialogBody>飞行记录器日志已保存至：{0}</RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.DialogBody>
  <RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.DontShowAgain>不再显示此对话框</RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.DontShowAgain>
  <RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.OpenFolder>打开文件夹</RimWorldAccess.FlightRecorder.OpenFolder>
  <RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.ShowRecordingSavedDialog.Label>保存飞行记录时显示对话框</RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.ShowRecordingSavedDialog.Label>
  <RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.ShowRecordingSavedDialog.Desc>当飞行记录器会话停止时({0})，打开一个显示已保存文件位置的对话框。关闭时将改为语音播报位置。</RimWorldAccess.Core.Settings.ShowRecordingSavedDialog.Desc>
</LanguageData>
